=document -/auto-toc
=begin rakudoc
=TITLE Test local plugins

This module can be used in a test suite and tests all files named in the META6 file with C<::Plugin::> in
their name.

If MAIN is called with a string, then that string is used as a namespace for the plugins, otherwise C<namespace=RakuDoc>

    MAIN('Elucid8')

will look for plugins prefixed by C<Elucid8::Plugin::>

=end rakudoc